# ZICCO v1 Prototype

This is a front-end prototype for the ZICCO transaction-request app.

Included:
- Home/service selection
- Order request form
- Local order history
- Rates screen
- Support screen
- Profile screen
- Mobile-friendly dark/gold UI
- PWA manifest

Important:
This prototype does NOT process, custody, exchange, or transfer real money, crypto, gift cards, or payment-provider balances. Before production, add secure authentication, a real backend/database, provider APIs, compliance/KYC/AML where applicable, audit logs, privacy/terms pages, and business/payment-provider approvals.

Open index.html in a browser to preview it. It can also be hosted as a web app/PWA.
